nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n{3}^{2y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={3}^{x}\\,.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275417 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25050499-14a7-5dc4-ab9a-bb2746663571" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{y}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={2}^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272711} {:answer/id #uuid "31b1aac8-08aa-5f55-8a92-c7f2de5e3b3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{2}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272834} {:answer/id #uuid "69ab19fa-2da0-5694-babc-dcaf4c1cbc74" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={2}^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273297} {:answer/id #uuid "c86bbe3a-aa64-534f-b564-ff975b747ff3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{y}^{3}}{{2}^{x}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274129} {:answer/id #uuid "dd413836-9565-5ef5-855f-8525ec3a92ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{2}^{-x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274333}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "25050499-14a7-5dc4-ab9a-bb2746663571" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{y}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={2}^{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272711} :answer-field/id #uuid "9311d56f-4976-5a5a-abe8-4574c024893b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274885}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "31bffd11-cf10-5855-9455-e621eb1969bd" :question/math-academy-id "q-158025" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{2}^{x}}{{y}^{3}}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={2}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n{y}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={2}^{x}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275418 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "511f2926-3a2d-5876-aadf-4d80c3a72b66" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273076} {:answer/id #uuid "542425f7-6cb3-5652-b4c4-c4e7fd2c0916" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273105} {:answer/id #uuid "5d4f8557-52a4-5276-a1e1-4b5aaf1bd9f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273190} {:answer/id #uuid "8eb6ea03-73f9-5ab9-bec2-771fcf49b774" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273623} {:answer/id #uuid "bc2a5003-9e7c-551d-aa36-6e3b23569a84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274015}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bc2a5003-9e7c-551d-aa36-6e3b23569a84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274015} :answer-field/id #uuid "c987bfcc-3ddd-51b1-9ee6-0c54d27baf82" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186274987}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e87161c3-2cae-55f5-bb92-55f97a5739b5" :question/math-academy-id "q-158026" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}{x}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A differentiable equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differentiable equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+{y}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275419 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "28ef5c14-78d0-5208-855a-6b41a420438a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={y}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186272752} {:answer/id #uuid "80fed0a8-073f-57d9-9a9b-52a42a33835b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\text{ }\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={y}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273493} {:answer/id #uuid "82123406-b934-5a9c-8160-0677d7d54cac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{y}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186273499} {:answer/id #uuid "c3e404da-fc1a-5a36-9bce-6763d8f34e26" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡x}{{y}^{2